{"id":"362397db3e7ee054","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-prop-absoluteness.md","title":"Absoluteness","display":"prop-absoluteness — Absoluteness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-absoluteness","aliases":["58-prop-absoluteness"],"display":"prop-absoluteness — Absoluteness","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-absolute.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-absoluteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-absoluteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-absoluteness — Absoluteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36b4649dd248921c\" href=\"?note=36b4649dd248921c\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-absolute.md\">../batch02/58-df-absolute.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma_\\in\\in V\">\\(\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma_\\in\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\\neq M\\subseteq N\">\\(\\emptyset\\neq M\\subseteq N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\in\">\\(\\Sigma_\\in\\)</span> the pure membership signature.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\\)</span> is the selected-recursion absoluteness predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36b4649dd248921c\" href=\"?note=36b4649dd248921c\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-absolute.md\">../batch02/58-df-absolute.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}absoluteness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma_\\in)\\land\nM,N\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\land\nM\\subseteq N\\land\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\n\\to \\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}absoluteness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma_\\in)\\land\nM,N\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\land\nM\\subseteq N\\land\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\n\\to \\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bounded quantifiers range over already assigned sets, so two nested transitive membership structures agree on every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> formula for assignments from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The conclusion uses the actual three-argument upstream predicate; it does not treat the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as a set-coded comparison structure.</li>\n<li>Absoluteness beyond bounded formulas requires separate hypotheses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-absolute.md","status":"resolved","id":"36b4649dd248921c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-absolute.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"2678ecfefaa83e32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"2678ecfefaa83e32","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-absolute.md","status":"resolved","id":"36b4649dd248921c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)$ is the selected-recursion absoluteness predicate from [[../batch02/58-df-absolute.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma_\\in\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset\\neq M\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}absoluteness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma_\\in)\\land\nM,N\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\land\nM\\subseteq N\\land\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\n\\to \\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1486,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3929","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-prop-absoluteness.md|58-prop-absoluteness]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["36b4649dd248921c","2678ecfefaa83e32","c14ba496c480dcd6"]}